---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' Same root cause as the explicit "#color" case, but reached through a
' stereotype-driven skinparam instead: the two notes must resolve their
' background colors from their own stereotype, not from whichever note
' was parsed last on the same side of the same class.
skinparam noteBackgroundColor<<yellowNote>> yellow
skinparam noteBackgroundColor<<blueNote>> lightblue

class G {
  int m1
  int m2
}
note right of G::m1 <<yellowNote>>
  m1 note, should be yellow
end note
note right of G::m2 <<blueNote>>
  m2 note, should be blue
end note
@enduml
